    rdfs:label "Evidence for Olibanum used in Pharmaceuticals & Druggists' Preparations: Watt (1908), Commercial Products of India, scan p. 186"@en ;
    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "It is computed that each tree yields annually about 2 lb. It is, however, probable that nearly all that has been written about its MEDICINAL properties refers to the imported olibanum, from which it must be carefully distinguished."@en ;
